# The PostgreSQL variation point attaches to the proto example of the HTTP
# variation point, whose handlers already take the repository's contract over
# the list aggregate, kept in memory: it adds src/Infrastructure/Postgres (the
# mapping of the aggregate, the repository, the translation of failures), the
# migration job src/App/App.Migrate, the command scope in BuildingBlocks, and the
# store failures middleware. The base files it changes are the composition root
# and the build files only: no handler, entity, or scenario of the module. The
# in-memory store stays, for the handlers' scenarios.
base library/architecture/dotnet/vp-http-api-in-dotnet.skill/examples-proto
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/App/App.Host/App.Host.csproj
change src/App/App.Host.Tests/App.Host.Tests.csproj
change Directory.Packages.props
change Todo.slnx
change Makefile
change README.md
